uros y los ejecutores oscuros sueltan los Fragmentos de cristal necrótico; hay más fragmentos, cristales negros, en el suelo entre las tiendas.",only={races={"Orc","Troll","Tauren","Skyborne"}},title="{quest:96897}"},{goals={{map=1420,npc=267009,npcName="Hadric Harlson",quest=96897,t="turnin",title="The Cult of the Damned",x=65.93,y=61.13},{map=1420,npc=267009,npcName="Hadric Harlson",quest=96898,t="turnin",title="Remnants of War",x=65.93,y=61.13}},only={races={"Orc","Troll","Tauren","Skyborne"}},title="{npc:267009}"},{goals={{area=228,map=1421,t="goto",text="{area:228}",x=44,y=40.9}},title="{area:228}"},{goals={{map=1421,npc=6389,npcName="Deathguard Podrig",only={races={"Scourge"}},quest=6321,t="accept",title="Supplying the Sepulcher",x=43.42,y=41.68},{area=228,location="The Sepulcher",map=1421,node=10,npc=2226,npcName="Karos Razok",t="getfp",x=45.62,y=42.6},{map=1421,npc=2226,npcName="Karos Razok",only={races={"Scourge"}},quest=6321,t="turnin",title="Supplying the Sepulcher",x=45.62,y=42.6},{map=1421,note="{npc:2226}: {npc:4556} en {zone:1458}, al final de esta guía; no hace falta comprar el vuelo",npc=2226,npcName="Karos Razok",only={races={"Scourge"}},quest=6323,t="accept",title="Ride to the Undercity",x=45.62,y=42.6},{map=1421,npc=2121,npcName="Shadow Priest Allister",quest=477,t="accept",title="Border Crossings",x=43.98,y=40.93},{map=1421,npc=1938,npcName="Dalar Dawnweaver",quest=421,t="accept",title="Prove Your Worth",x=44.2,y=39.81},{map=1421,note="{npc:1952}, bajo tierra",npc=1952,npcName="High Executor Hadrec",quest=428,t="accept",title="Lost Deathstalkers",x=43.42,y=40.86},{map=1421,npc=1952,npcName="High Executor Hadrec",quest=437,t="accept",title="The Dead Fields",x=43.42,y=40.86},{map=1421,note="{npc:1937}: {quest:445}",npc=1937,npcName="Apothecary Renferrel",quest=445,t="turnin",title="Delivery to Silverpine Forest",x=42.8,y=40.86}},note="{area:228} es el pueblo cripta de los Renegados en medio del bosque. Todos los que necesitas están alrededor de la