="turnin",title="Al'Aketh Thugs",x=38.31,y=30.18}},note="{npc:252095} espera en {area:16622}, al suroeste de la aldea. El campamento Al'Aketh está justo más allá; {npc:256935} lo dirige.\nCuidado: {npc:256935} lanza descargas; aléjalo de los otros sectarios antes de pelear para que no se unan.",title="{npc:252095}"},{goals={{map=2521,npc=251374,npcName="Windshaper Boro",only={classes={"SHAMAN"}},quest=92466,t="turnin",title="Call of Earth",x=42.79,y=23.58},{map=2521,npc=251374,npcName="Windshaper Boro",only={classes={"SHAMAN"}},quest=92467,t="accept",title="Call of Earth",x=42.79,y=23.58},{map=2521,note="bebe {item:6635} en {area:16988}, justo al este de la aldea, para ver a {npc:251166}",npc=251166,npcName="Minor Manifestation of Earth",only={classes={"SHAMAN"}},quest=92467,t="turnin",title="Call of Earth",x=49.67,y=23.8},{map=2521,npc=251166,npcName="Minor Manifestation of Earth",only={classes={"SHAMAN"}},quest=92468,t="accept",title="Call of Earth",x=49.67,y=23.8},{map=2521,note="{npc:251374}: {npc:5873} y tu {item:5175}",npc=251374,npcName="Windshaper Boro",only={classes={"SHAMAN"}},quest=92468,t="turnin",title="Call of Earth",x=42.79,y=23.58}},note="De vuelta con Boro en {area:16635} con el Sello.",only={classes={"SHAMAN"}},title="{npc:251374}"},{goals={{map=2521,npc=251523,npcName="Constable Aonda",quest=92472,t="turnin",title="The Next Step",x=45.67,y=45.5},{map=2521,npc=251523,npcName="Constable Aonda",quest=92514,t="accept",title="Welcome to Shen'dar Village",x=45.67,y=45.5},{map=2521,npc=251902,npcName="Illaya Amberwind",quest=92595,t="accept",title="The Windshapers",x=43.51,y=44.77},{map=2521,note="habla con {npc:251902}",npc=251902,npcName="Illaya Amberwind",oi=1,quest=92595,t="talk",title="The Windshapers",x=43.53,y=44.78},{map=2521,npc=251902,npcName="Illaya Amberwind",quest=92595,t="turnin",title="The Windshapers",x=43.51,y=44.77},{map=2521,npc=251902,npcName="Illaya Amberwind",quest=94411,t="accept",title="Meddlesome Mages",x=43.51,y=44.77},{map=2521