",object=175320,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=98025,t="accept",title="WANTED: Jai'vhanel",x=37.22,y=44.22},{map=1439,note="{npc:3666}, arriba en la posada",npc=3666,npcName="Wizbang Cranktoggle",quest=983,t="accept",title="Buzzbox 827",x=36.97,y=44.13},{area=442,location="Auberdine",map=1439,node=26,npc=3841,npcName="Caylais Moonfeather",t="getfp",x=36.34,y=45.58},{map=1439,note="{npc:10219} (los elfos de la noche la tienen desde {zone:1438})",npc=10219,npcName="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde",quest=3524,t="accept",title="Washed Ashore",x=36.62,y=45.59},{map=1439,note="{npc:10216}, en el muelle",npc=10216,npcName="Gubber Blump",quest=1138,t="accept",title="Fruit of the Sea",x=36.1,y=44.93}},note="El barco atraca al oeste de la aldea: {npc:3644} espera donde el muelle se une con la orilla. Sube primero a {npc:3649}, en el extremo norte de la aldea, luego baja por la calle principal hasta la posada. El maestro de vuelo está en la colina al sur de la posada. {npc:3666} está arriba en la posada: sube por la escalera de adentro, la flecha no distingue los pisos.",title="{area:442}"},{goals={{map=1439,note="{npc:10216}, en el muelle",npc=10216,npcName="Gubber Blump",optional=true,quest=1141,t="accept",title="The Family and the Fishing Pole",x=36.1,y=44.93}},note="Solo pescadores: {npc:10216} está en el muelle. Su {item:12238} se pesca desde el propio muelle.",title="{npc:10216}",when={{k="skill",n=1,name="Fishing",skillLine=356}}},{goals={{count=1,item=12242,itemName="Sea Creature Bones",map=1439,oi=1,quest=3524,t="collect",title="Washed Ashore",x=36.37,y=50.92},{count=6,item=12238,itemName="Darkshore Grouper",map=1439,note="{item:12238}: pesca desde el muelle",oi=1,optional=true,quest=1141,t="collect",title="The Family and the Fishing Pole",x=36.1,y=44.9},{count=6,item=5385,itemName="Crawler Leg",map=1439,note="Patas de reptador",oi=1,quest=983,t="collect",title="Buzzbox 827",x=35.6,y=47.1},{map=1439,objName="Buzzbox 827",object=17182,quest=983,t="turnin",title="Buzzbox 827",x=36.64,y=46.26},{map=1439,objName="Buzzbox 827",object=17182,quest=1001,t="accept",title="Buzzbox 411",x=36.64,y=46.26}},note="Los Reptadores de marea ({npc:2232}) corretean por la orilla bajo el pueblo; {quest:983} está en la playa, justo al sur de los muelles. Los Trilladores de Costa Oscura ({npc:2185}) nadan en los bajíos. {object:175207} yace en la orilla, justo al sur del pueblo.",title="La playa"},{goals={{map=1439,npc=10219,npcName="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde",quest=3524,t="turnin",title="Washed Ashore",x=36.62,y=45.59},{map=1439,note="{quest:3524}: las tortugas marinas varadas de más arriba en la costa solo ofrecen sus misiones una vez entregada",npc=10219,npcName="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde",quest=4681,t="accept",title="Washed Ashore",x=36.62,y=45.59},{map=1439,npc=10216,npcName="Gubber Blump",optional=true,quest=1141,t="turnin",title="The Family and the Fishing Pole",x=36.1,y=44.93},{area=442,location="Auberdine",map=1439,npc=6737,npcName="Innkeeper Shaussiy",t="sethome",x=37.04,y=44.13}},title="{area:442}"},{goals={{count=1,item=12289,itemName="Sea Turtle Remains",map=1439,note="{item:12289}, en la playa al oeste de los muelles; bajo el agua",oi=1,quest=4681,t="collect",title="Washed Ashore",x=31.82,y=46.31},{map=1439,npc=10219,npcName="Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde",quest=4681,t="turnin",title="Washed Ashore",x=36.62,y=45.59}},title="La tortuga esquelética"},{goals={{map=1439,note="los osos cardo rabiosos más cercanos a {npc:3701}",only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=2118,startItem=7586,t="complete",title="Plagued Lands",x=38.21,y=52.59},{map=1439,npc=3701,npcName="Tharnariun Treetender",only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=2118,t="turnin",title="Plagued Lands",x=38.84,y=43.42},{map=1439,npc=3701,npcName="Tharnariun Treetender",quest=2138,t="accept",title="Cleansing of the Infected",x=38.84,y=43.42}},note="Los osos cardo rabiosos rondan las colinas justo al este de {area:442}. Usa {quest:2139} en uno y llévalo de vuelta con él.",title="Osos apestados"},{goals={{count=20,map=1439,npc=2164,oi=1,quest=2138,t="kill",target="Rabid Thistle Bear",title="Cleansing of the Infected",x=38.21,y=52.59}},title="{npc:2164} por el camino"},{goals={{map=1439,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},t="goto",x=39.9,y=53.9},{map=1439,quest=984,t="complete",title="How Big a Threat?",x=39.9,y=53.9}},note="Mata osos cardo rabiosos en las colinas al este de {area:442} y luego sube al campamento fúrbolg al sureste de ellos: aún no hay que matar nada.",title="Osos y el campamento Bosque Negro"},{goals={{map=1439,objName="Beached Sea Turtle",object=176190,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=4722,t="accept",title="Beached Sea Turtle",x=37.09,y=62.18},{map=1439,npc=3639,npcName="Sentinel Tysha Moonblade",only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=953,t="accept",title="The Fall of Ameth'Aran",x=40.3,y=59.73},{count=7,item=5360,itemName="Highborne Relic",map=1439,note="Reliquias de Altonato",oi=1,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=958,t="collect",title="Tools of the Highborne",x=41.62,y=59.63},{count=20,map=1439,npc=2164,oi=1,quest=2138,t="kill",target="Rabid Thistle Bear",title="Cleansing of the Infected",x=40.09,y=58.31},{count=1,item=281038,itemName="Feather of Jai'vhanel",map=1439,oi=1,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=98025,t="collect",title="WANTED: Jai'vhanel",x=41.9,y=57.82},{map=1439,note="Lee {object:17188}",objName="The Lay of Ameth'Aran",object=17188,oi=1,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=953,t="interact",title="The Fall of Ameth'Aran",x=43.3,y=58.68},{map=1439,note="Lee {object:17189}",objName="The Fall of Ameth'Aran",object=17189,oi=2,only={races={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},quest=953,t="interact",title="The Fall of Ameth'Aran",x=42.65,y=63.14},{count=1,item=5382,itemName="Anaya's Pendant",map=1439,oi=1,quest=963,t="collect",title="For Love Eternal",x=41.81,y=60.73},{map=1